WEBVTT

00:05:29.276 --> 00:05:31.725
And our training is unparalleled.

00:05:32.639 --> 00:05:33.939
I just want you to imagine.

00:05:33.963 --> 00:05:36.091
It's like a revival, tent-like festival,

00:05:36.115 --> 00:05:39.390
not unlike the civil rights
movement teach-ins.

00:05:39.414 --> 00:05:41.885
And we're going to go
all across the country.

00:05:41.909 --> 00:05:44.179
It is the biggest announcement this week:

00:05:44.203 --> 00:05:47.334
Vanessa and I and a team
of masterful teachers,

00:05:47.358 --> 00:05:49.696
all to culminate next year,

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.437
on sacred ground,

00:05:51.461 --> 00:05:53.365
in Selma, Alabama,

00:05:53.389 --> 00:05:59.018
to create a new annual tradition
that we are calling "Summer of Selma."

00:05:59.482 --> 00:06:02.070
VG: Summer of Selma will be
an annual pilgrimage